<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>China</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial;
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
    }

    h1 {
      color: gold;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #222;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 15px auto;
      border-radius: 12px;
      max-width: 500px;
    }

    h2 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    p {
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 30px;
      color: lightblue;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 18px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<h1>🇨🇳 China</h1>

<div class="card">
  <h2>📍 Cities</h2>
  <p>Beijing • Shanghai • Xi’an • Chengdu</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>📅 Duration</h2>
  <p>10 Days</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>✨ Highlights</h2>
  
</div>
<p>
Great Wall of China<br>
Forbidden City & Beijing history<br>
Terracotta Army in Xi’an<br>
Shanghai skyline & Bund<br>
Chengdu pandas
</p>

<div class="card">
  <h2>🍜 Food</h2>
  <p>Peking Duck • Dumplings • Hot Pot • Noodles</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>💡 Travel Tips</h2>
  <p>
Use Alipay / WeChat Pay<br>
VPN needed for Google apps<br>
High-speed trains are excellent<br>
Carry passport at all times
</p>

</div>

<a href="/">⬅ Back</a>

</body>
</html>
